RandomGenus14Curves -- Construction of random curves of genus 14
****************************************************************

Description
===========

In this package the unirationality construction of the moduli space $M_{14}$ of
curves of genus 14 due to Verra is implemented. The main references are

\ \ \ \ \ [Mu] S. Mukai, Curves, $K3$ surfaces and Fano $3$-folds of genus
$\leq 10$. Algebraic geometry and commutative algebra, Vol. I, 357-377,
Kinokuniya, Tokyo, 1988.

\ \ \ \ \ [Ve] A. Verra, The unirationality of the moduli spaces of curves of
genus 14 or lower. Compos. Math. 141 (2005), no. 6, 1425-1444.

